DATA ATTRIBUTION (separate licenses for embedded data files)

This software embeds geographic reference data from third-party sources.
The Software code itself is MIT-licensed as above, but the embedded data
retains its original license:

1. **ubigeo_consolidated.json** (Peru: 25 departments, 196 provinces, 1,892 districts)
   - Source: RitchieRD/ubigeos-peru-data
   - License: Open Database License (ODbL)
   - URL: https://github.com/RitchieRD/ubigeos-peru-data
   - Attribution: Required. See https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

2. **ccpp_by_distrito.json** (Peru: 43,491 centros poblados across 1,851 districts)
   - Source: GeoNames (geonames.org)
   - License: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC BY 4.0)
   - URL: http://download.geonames.org/export/dump/PE.zip
   - Modification: Grouped by distrito (6-digit ubigeo)
   - Attribution: Required. See https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The MIT license above applies to the Software code only. Users of this
software who redistribute the embedded data must comply with the original
licenses (ODbL and CC BY 4.0) and provide proper attribution.
